{"4779600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bearly Surviving", "steam_appid": 4779600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779600/extras/746392798e7bf4917e94735f2f2a2c6b.poster.avif?t=1788138766\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779600/extras/746392798e7bf4917e94735f2f2a2c6b.webm?t=1788138766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779600/extras/746392798e7bf4917e94735f2f2a2c6b.mp4?t=1788138766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through endless waves of animals that have teamed up to take you down in this beat ’em up action roguelite. Collect absurd items, create chaotic builds, unlock and upgrade bears with unique playstyles, and survive as long as possible while reclaiming your spot at the top of the food chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run unfolds differently through unpredictable item combinations, escalating enemy hordes, mini-boss encounters, and powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779600/extras/06fa8338b1cdfa413ba733cddcfa05aa.poster.avif?t=1788138766\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779600/extras/06fa8338b1cdfa413ba733cddcfa05aa.webm?t=1788138766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779600/extras/06fa8338b1cd